      "q": "Which decision supersedes the explicit frozen verdict for managed markers and the remote-push-approval schema: the B-5a88 CHK-002/CHK-004 canonical-write plan, or brand-rename/identity-migration compatibility?",
      "evidence": "The current decisions mark <!-- lattice:start/end --> and lattice.remote-push-approval.v1 as FROZEN because changing them can orphan installed blocks or break exact-match approval validation, while B-5a88 requires new proof-or-stop markers and schema plus dual-read.",
