      "resolution": "B-5a88 CHK-002 explicitly supersedes the older frozen-marker verdict for new writes: proof-or-stop:start/end are canonical, while lattice:start/end remain a read-only compatibility probe for already-installed managed blocks. This is the current story requirement, not a rewrite of archived evidence.",
      "resolvedAt": "2026-08-20T05:07:50.700Z"
